          "title": "Read the graph",
          "body": "For part (i),\n\n\\[\n\\vec{OQ}=2\\mathbf b\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\vec{AQ}=\\vec{OQ}-\\vec{OA}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\vec{AQ}=2\\mathbf b-10\\mathbf a\n\\]"
