      "finalAnswer": "\\(\\vec{AQ}=2\\mathbf b-10\\mathbf a\\), \\(\\displaystyle \\vec{OP}=\\frac{15}{2}\\mathbf a+\\frac52\\mathbf b\\), \\(\\displaystyle \\vec{OR}=\\frac{15}{4}\\mathbf a+\\frac54\\mathbf b\\)"
